===Down to the Depths===
[[Team Magma]]{{sup/3|R}}/[[Team Aqua]]{{sup/3|S}} has stolen [[Captain Stern]]'s submarine, and there's not a moment to lose! {{m|Surf}} to the south side of the ring of shallow water, then {{m|Dive}} into the deep water to find a cave entrance. Swim inside to enter the [[Seafloor Cavern]] and find [[Captain Stern]]'s stolen submarine. Use Dive again to surface and enter the main part of the cave.
